{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48793","headline":"凤阁南厅槐树半生死虽遇阳和终呈枯朽托根清禁颇觉非宜感物缘情率尔爲咏 · 李怀远","name":"凤阁南厅槐树半生死虽遇阳和终呈枯朽托根清禁颇觉非宜感物缘情率尔爲咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭槐岁月深，半死尚抽心。\n叶少宁障日，枝疎不碍禽。\n帷幄谅无取，栋梁非所在。\n媿在龙楼侧，羞处凤池阴。\n未能辞雨露，犹得款衣簪。\n惜悲生意尽，空余古木吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李怀远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}